<title>USA: CFP Holdings sets $115 mln 144A snr gtd notes.</title>
<headline>CFP Holdings sets $115 mln 144A snr gtd notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from CFP Holdings was priced in the private placement market, according to lead manager NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CFP HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $115 MLN	  COUPON 11.625 PCT MATURITY 1/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR GTD NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 07/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3     YIELD  11.625     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS     SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE AFTER FOUR</p>
<p>								   YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: three equity call for $40 million at 110.</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
